// Cisco File Deletion | T1070.004, T1561.001, T1561.002 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/network/cisco/aaa/cisco_cli_file_deletion.yml
*erase* OR *delete* OR *format*

// Stellar Cyber Query Builder (DSL):
{
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must": [
        {
          "query_string": {
            "query": "*erase* OR *delete* OR *format*",
            "analyze_wildcard": true
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
